## Required guardrail policy: SpottoGuardrails
```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "ReadAwsAccountInformation",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "account:GetAccountInformation",
      "Resource": "*"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "DenyCredentialValueReads",
      "Effect": "Deny",
      "Action": [
        "ssm:GetParameter",
        "ssm:GetParameters",
        "ssm:GetParameterHistory",
        "ssm:GetParametersByPath",
        "secretsmanager:GetSecretValue",
        "secretsmanager:BatchGetSecretValue"
      ],
      "Resource": "*"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "DenyS3ObjectReadsOutsideBillingScopes",
      "Effect": "Deny",
      "Action": "s3:GetObject*",
      "NotResource": "arn:aws:s3:::example-cost-exports/cur2/example-cur2/*"
    }
  ]
}
```

## Required union billing policy: SpottoBillingExportRead
```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Sid": "ReadBucketLocation0130e1c52a",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "s3:GetBucketLocation",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::example-cost-exports"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "ListDeliveryRoot01ac4ae0dc",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "s3:ListBucket",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::example-cost-exports",
      "Condition": {
        "StringLike": {
          "s3:prefix": [
            "cur2/example-cur2",
            "cur2/example-cur2/*"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "Sid": "ReadDeliveryObjects01ac4ae0dc",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "s3:GetObject",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::example-cost-exports/cur2/example-cur2/*"
    },
    {
      "Sid": "DecryptBillingObjects",
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "kms:Decrypt",
        "kms:DescribeKey"
      ],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:kms:us-east-1:000011112222:key/11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555"
    }
  ]
}
```

> KMS-encrypted exports also require the customer-managed KMS key policy to allow this role to use kms:Decrypt and kms:DescribeKey.

